# CR 500.4's own "every player" scope, land.go's cleanupStep extension: once
# Cleanup actually runs (Main1 -> ... -> Cleanup, 9 more advances), this
# turn's LandsPlayed rolls into LandsPlayedLastTurn and resets to zero,
# ready for a land to be played again once a future turn reaches Main1 --
# TestCleanupResetsLandsPlayedForEveryPlayer (land_test.go) is the unit-level
# version of the same rule; this is its scenario-level counterpart.
startturn human
advance 3
playland human 1
advance 9
